const response=["# Adversarial correction self-check - 2026-11-02","","This is the author's response to the independent Astra input, not independent acceptance. All 73 exact revised versions await re-review and Melissa's clinical approval. Six PASS main items received only note-specific clarity/scope changes; every REVISE/FAIL item has indexed cue/fairness/suggestion responses in the JSON packets. The immutable Astra verdicts remain unchanged.","","The current JSON before fields now show the exact drafts attacked by Astra; originalAuthoringBefore preserves the earlier authoring baseline. Each after field is projected from the live assembled source. Clinical detail changes, visible prior feedback/results, rationales and exact lint spans are included. The owner page is published by the manager, not this worker.","","## Exact approvals recorded","","Existing AuthoredClinicalRecord metadata is used: `clinically_approved` and `lastClinicianReview`, reviewer `Melissa Rowland (clinical sign-off)`. No new approval workflow or schema is introduced.","","| Audit ID | Exact version | Date |","|---|---|---|"];
